# mend/ is the Meridian break surface for the Mend project — a deliberately
# fictional biotech pipeline site. It has nothing to do with SummerScope and
# must not be served from summerscope.vercel.app, which vercel.json would
# otherwise do: outputDirectory is ".", so every file in the repo root is
# published as static output.
#
# This only affects deployments rooted at the repo root. Vercel reads
# .vercelignore from a project's configured Root Directory, so a separate Mend
# project with Root Directory = mend reads mend/.vercelignore (absent) and
# deploys normally.
mend/
